1
00:00:16,510 --> 00:00:18,510
Last time I went to the old estate,

2
00:00:18,920 --> 00:00:21,550
Mr. Song Jing seemed to
live in the basement.

3
00:00:21,710 --> 00:00:24,030
All I knew was that he was kept locked
in his room the whole time.

4
00:00:24,760 --> 00:00:26,000
I never heard of any basement.

5
00:00:30,510 --> 00:00:31,320
Jing.

6
00:00:32,520 --> 00:00:33,689
I think

7
00:00:33,731 --> 00:00:35,409
we need to go back there.

8
00:00:35,451 --> 00:00:36,710
=Dear Song=
See what we can find.

9
00:00:37,300 --> 00:00:39,500
=Episode 19=
(Glimmer)

10
00:01:38,120 --> 00:01:41,310
Song Jing used to love teaching me
to draw.

11
00:02:20,310 --> 00:02:22,710
I gave this to him for his birthday.

12
00:02:25,430 --> 00:02:26,539
He said it was

13
00:02:26,581 --> 00:02:28,190
the warmest gift he'd ever received.

14
00:02:30,560 --> 00:02:31,520
After the incident,

15
00:02:32,080 --> 00:02:33,120
he wasn't doing well emotionally.

16
00:02:33,710 --> 00:02:34,520
I tried to comfort him.

17
00:02:36,310 --> 00:02:37,400
He said this teddy bear made him feel

18
00:02:37,910 --> 00:02:39,150
like I was carrying him on my back.

19
00:02:49,590 --> 00:02:50,680
What's wrong?

20
00:02:51,430 --> 00:02:52,800
I think there's something inside.

21
00:02:58,430 --> 00:02:59,400
A voice recorder.

22
00:03:00,560 --> 00:03:02,689
Song Jing used to make audio recordings

23
00:03:02,731 --> 00:03:04,190
of his daily life.

24
00:03:04,520 --> 00:03:05,400
Could it be...

25
00:03:08,750 --> 00:03:10,520
Maybe he recorded something.

26
00:03:28,190 --> 00:03:30,449
(Sis came to yell at me again.)

27
00:03:30,491 --> 00:03:32,409
(She called me a monster.)

28
00:03:32,451 --> 00:03:34,659
(She wants me gone forever.)

29
00:03:34,701 --> 00:03:35,750
(I'm so scared.)

30
00:03:36,080 --> 00:03:38,840
(How long will Dad keep me locked up?)

31
00:03:39,120 --> 00:03:41,240
(It's thundering. The room is so dark.)

32
00:03:43,190 --> 00:03:44,000
Song Huan!

33
00:03:48,030 --> 00:03:49,190
It's a shame this recording

34
00:03:50,560 --> 00:03:52,190
can't prove Song Huan was the killer.

35
00:03:53,150 --> 00:03:54,120
Sometimes,

36
00:03:57,120 --> 00:03:58,910
you don't need to prove
who the killer is.

37
00:04:02,750 --> 00:04:04,710
Song Huan's birthday party is coming up.

38
00:04:05,840 --> 00:04:07,569
She'll probably use this chance

39
00:04:07,611 --> 00:04:09,120
to confront Song Huaishan.

40
00:04:10,430 --> 00:04:11,310
When that happens,

41
00:04:13,360 --> 00:04:14,910
this could prove very useful.

42
00:04:22,940 --> 00:04:26,140
(Happy Birthday)

43
00:04:28,190 --> 00:04:29,729
Thank you to all

44
00:04:29,771 --> 00:04:31,139
our shareholders and partners

45
00:04:31,181 --> 00:04:33,920
for celebrating my 29th birthday.

46
00:04:34,310 --> 00:04:36,019
I hope we can work together

47
00:04:36,061 --> 00:04:38,899
to build a brighter future
for Song Group.

48
00:04:38,941 --> 00:04:40,539
Great!

49
00:04:40,581 --> 00:04:42,289
Under Ms. Song Huan's leadership,

50
00:04:42,331 --> 00:04:43,510
Song Group keeps getting better!

51
00:04:43,800 --> 00:04:44,929
Happy birthday, Ms. Song Huan!

52
00:04:44,971 --> 00:04:47,310
Happy birthday!

53
00:05:06,510 --> 00:05:07,950
With a good daughter like this,

54
00:05:08,600 --> 00:05:10,000
looks like I can retire.

55
00:05:11,600 --> 00:05:12,920
If you're tired, Dad,

56
00:05:13,360 --> 00:05:14,430
you can retire anytime.

57
00:05:16,000 --> 00:05:16,950
I'll handle Song Group.

58
00:05:18,560 --> 00:05:20,510
I'm still going strong.

59
00:05:21,120 --> 00:05:22,040
Blow out the candles.

60
00:05:36,630 --> 00:05:38,720
(Sis came to yell at me again.)

61
00:05:38,800 --> 00:05:40,750
(She called me a monster.)

62
00:05:41,120 --> 00:05:43,000
(She wants me gone forever.)

63
00:05:43,120 --> 00:05:44,070
(I'm so scared.)

64
00:05:44,430 --> 00:05:45,929
(How long will Dad keep me)

65
00:05:45,971 --> 00:05:47,190
(locked up?)

66
00:05:48,270 --> 00:05:49,480
(It's thundering.)

67
00:05:49,630 --> 00:05:51,000
(The room is so dark.)

68
00:05:58,920 --> 00:06:00,310
Everyone here,

69
00:06:00,510 --> 00:06:03,190
I'm sure plenty of you don't like me.

70
00:06:04,310 --> 00:06:06,409
But making up such a childish recording

71
00:06:06,451 --> 00:06:07,750
just to smear me

72
00:06:08,720 --> 00:06:10,120
is pretty laughable, isn't it?

73
00:06:10,510 --> 00:06:11,920
I'm so sorry, everyone,

74
00:06:13,040 --> 00:06:14,800
for putting you through this farce.

75
00:06:15,240 --> 00:06:16,240
This must be

76
00:06:16,600 --> 00:06:18,249
a dirty trick by one of

77
00:06:18,291 --> 00:06:19,430
Song Group's rivals.

78
00:06:19,920 --> 00:06:21,099
They chose

79
00:06:21,141 --> 00:06:22,480
Song Huan's birthday

80
00:06:22,920 --> 00:06:23,750
to slander her

81
00:06:24,240 --> 00:06:25,510
and hurt Song Group.

82
00:06:26,510 --> 00:06:27,920
I'll investigate this thoroughly

83
00:06:28,510 --> 00:06:29,600
and hold whoever did it accountable.

84
00:06:39,040 --> 00:06:39,830
Dad.

85
00:06:40,950 --> 00:06:42,510
But that voice just now...

86
00:06:43,000 --> 00:06:44,720
It sounded like Song Jing.

87
00:06:44,800 --> 00:06:46,120
There was a rumor back then

88
00:06:46,390 --> 00:06:48,600
that Song Huan was involved in
Song Jing's death,

89
00:06:48,720 --> 00:06:50,729
and that his own older sister
drove him into depression.

90
00:06:50,771 --> 00:06:51,720
You heard that too?

91
00:06:52,000 --> 00:06:53,289
I heard about it back then,

92
00:06:53,331 --> 00:06:55,240
but the story was quickly hushed up.

93
00:06:57,830 --> 00:06:58,630
Everyone,

94
00:06:59,160 --> 00:07:00,539
what can a voice recorder

95
00:07:00,581 --> 00:07:01,950
actually prove?

96
00:07:02,750 --> 00:07:04,240
As for my daughter,

97
00:07:04,800 --> 00:07:05,750
I know her best.

98
00:07:06,190 --> 00:07:08,920
Don't believe these rumors.

99
00:07:09,190 --> 00:07:11,600
Dad, are you still defending her?

100
00:07:18,160 --> 00:07:20,190
If the voice recorder isn't enough,

101
00:07:20,310 --> 00:07:22,600
then what about this draft agreement

102
00:07:22,750 --> 00:07:23,920
she secretly signed

103
00:07:24,120 --> 00:07:26,099
with Mr. Zhang, Director Li, and others

104
00:07:26,141 --> 00:07:28,270
on share swaps
and improper benefit transfers?

105
00:07:28,800 --> 00:07:31,630
It spells out exactly when and how

106
00:07:31,750 --> 00:07:33,019
to dilute

107
00:07:33,061 --> 00:07:34,720
your shareholding.

108
00:07:35,510 --> 00:07:36,720
This is a copy.

109
00:07:37,040 --> 00:07:38,409
The original is with Mr. Yu.

110
00:07:38,451 --> 00:07:39,800
You can verify it anytime.

111
00:07:42,390 --> 00:07:43,240
(Song Huan.)

112
00:07:43,630 --> 00:07:47,360
(Enjoy the birthday gift
I prepared for you.)

113
00:07:55,240 --> 00:07:56,160
Dad.

114
00:07:57,430 --> 00:07:58,870
Sis's coming after

115
00:08:00,120 --> 00:08:01,360
you, too.

116
00:08:10,920 --> 00:08:11,720
Good.

117
00:08:12,510 --> 00:08:13,390
Song Huan...

118
00:08:13,870 --> 00:08:15,310
You monster!

119
00:08:17,240 --> 00:08:18,630
For the group's sake,

120
00:08:19,120 --> 00:08:20,310
for the Song family's honor,

121
00:08:21,630 --> 00:08:22,510
I've kept this secret buried

122
00:08:23,390 --> 00:08:24,510
for all these years.

123
00:08:25,040 --> 00:08:26,720
Whatever you did in the company,

124
00:08:26,920 --> 00:08:28,560
I turned a blind eye.

125
00:08:29,510 --> 00:08:30,720
But now you've gone too far.

126
00:08:30,950 --> 00:08:32,360
You drove your brother to his death.

127
00:08:32,910 --> 00:08:33,790
And now...

128
00:08:34,320 --> 00:08:37,960
you even want to take down
your own father, you viper!

129
00:08:38,390 --> 00:08:39,910
You're insane!

130
00:08:46,750 --> 00:08:47,720
A viper?

131
00:08:53,510 --> 00:08:54,840
If I'm a viper,

132
00:08:56,750 --> 00:08:57,550
Song Huaishan,

133
00:08:59,440 --> 00:09:01,550
you raised me to be one.

134
00:09:03,000 --> 00:09:04,550
Who taught me from childhood

135
00:09:05,000 --> 00:09:06,910
that only the ruthless survive?

136
00:09:08,600 --> 00:09:11,550
Who praised me for being bold
the first time I snatched

137
00:09:11,750 --> 00:09:13,000
Song Jing's toy?

138
00:09:13,510 --> 00:09:15,960
When I cut his face,

139
00:09:16,240 --> 00:09:17,099
whose first reaction

140
00:09:17,141 --> 00:09:18,790
was to cover my mouth

141
00:09:19,200 --> 00:09:20,939
and say the Song family couldn't
afford a scandal?

142
00:09:20,981 --> 00:09:22,120
It was you!

143
00:09:24,600 --> 00:09:26,120
Your cruelty,

144
00:09:26,440 --> 00:09:27,529
your obsession with fame and fortune,

145
00:09:27,571 --> 00:09:29,600
made me who I am today!

146
00:09:30,720 --> 00:09:31,960
I pushed Song Jing.

147
00:09:32,320 --> 00:09:33,910
But you welded shut the cage

148
00:09:35,150 --> 00:09:37,120
that trapped him until he died!

149
00:09:39,720 --> 00:09:40,510
Song Huan.

150
00:09:41,030 --> 00:09:42,030
As of now,

151
00:09:42,360 --> 00:09:45,630
you're relieved of all duties!

152
00:09:45,960 --> 00:09:47,550
Get out!

153
00:09:48,720 --> 00:09:49,459
And the rest of you.

154
00:09:49,501 --> 00:09:51,360
Not a word of what you heard

155
00:09:52,120 --> 00:09:53,200
leaves this room.

156
00:09:53,790 --> 00:09:54,840
If anyone talks,

157
00:09:55,720 --> 00:09:56,979
I, Song Huaishan,

158
00:09:57,021 --> 00:09:58,790
won't let them off!

159
00:09:59,320 --> 00:10:00,910
Now get out!

160
00:10:12,390 --> 00:10:13,200
Dad!

161
00:10:13,360 --> 00:10:14,150
Dad!

162
00:10:14,600 --> 00:10:15,200
Mr. Song!

163
00:10:15,720 --> 00:10:16,320
Mr. Song!

164
00:10:16,750 --> 00:10:17,550
Wake up!

165
00:10:18,630 --> 00:10:19,390
Mr. Song!
